01:07:34,748 --> 01:07:37,610
事实证明，如果你把它做大一点，电池就好多了。
it turns out if you make it bigger, the battery is better.

1240
01:07:37,650 --> 01:07:39,250
所以我挺满意的。
So I've been happy with that.

1241
01:07:39,770 --> 01:07:41,113
你有没有最喜欢的人生格言，
Do you have a favorite life motto

1242
01:07:41,113 --> 01:07:43,650
在工作或生活中经常想起来的那种？
that you find yourself coming back to often in work or in life?

1243
01:07:44,010 --> 01:07:47,490
有一本非虚构书，真的是我最喜欢的书之一。
There's like one nonfiction book that really is like one of my favorite ever.

1244
01:07:47,730 --> 01:07:53,810
书名叫 4,000 Weeks，里面有很多我觉得很酷的东西。
It's 4,000 Weeks, and it has a lot in it that I think is cool.

1245
01:07:54,530 --> 01:07:59,105
其中一个很酷的点，也是我特别有共鸣的地方，
And one of the cool things is this sort of thing that was really relevant to me,

1246
01:07:59,105 --> 01:08:03,252
就是“等我终于……”这种心态很常见，
which is that, like, the 'when I finally' mentality is a common mentality

1247
01:08:03,252 --> 01:08:04,610
而且有点有毒。
and it's kind of toxic.

1248
01:08:04,730 --> 01:08:05,690
那是什么意思？
So, so what does that mean?

1249
01:08:05,730 --> 01:08:10,090
就像那种“啊，等我终于把待办清单上的所有事项都勾掉”，
It's sort of this like, ah, when I finally, you know, check off this, this,

1250
01:08:10,090 --> 01:08:11,805
把待办清单上的所有事项都勾掉，
all the items on my to do list,

1251
01:08:11,805 --> 01:08:15,450
等我终于结婚了，我就能放松下来了。
I'll finally be able to chill when I finally get like married.

1252
01:08:15,610 --> 01:08:17,170
等我终于升职了，我就会快乐。
I'll be happy when I finally get a promotion.

1253
01:08:18,090 --> 01:08:21,526
这有点像是你之前谈到冥想时，对吧，
And then this is sort of when you were talking about meditation, right,

1254
01:08:21,526 --> 01:08:24,730
这几乎就是冥想的反面，就是说，
this is like almost the opposite of meditation and that, you know,

1255
01:08:24,730 --> 01:08:28,515
到头来，你的生活就是所有你活在当下的时刻。
at the end of the day, your life is like all of the moments you lived in the moment

1256
01:08:28,515 --> 01:08:32,010
在某种意义上，你应该尽量总是……
and that there's the sense in which you should just try to always, like, be

1257
01:08:32,170 --> 01:08:35,751
你知道，活在当下，而不是把自己投向一个……
You know, in the moment and not projecting yourself towards like a future

1258
01:08:35,751 --> 01:08:36,690
看似更好的未来。
that seems better.

1259
01:08:36,770 --> 01:08:40,350
可能如果你总对自己说，等我终于做到 X 时，我就会快乐。
Like probably if you're telling yourself, when I finally do X, I'll be happy.

1260
01:08:40,430 --> 01:08:41,790
但等你真做到 X 时，你不会快乐。
When you do X, you will not be happy.

1261
01:08:42,150 --> 01:08:44,390
有没有更好的说法，还是只能“别这样想”？
Is there a better phrase to use or is it just don't do that?

1262
01:08:44,550 --> 01:08:46,830
他们是不是会这么说，呃，我也不太清楚。
Like do they say, uh, I don't know.

1263
01:08:46,830 --> 01:08:49,830
对我来说，积极的版本大概是活在当下，对吧？
I think to me that the positive version is like be in the moment, right?

1264
01:08:49,830 --> 01:08:52,590
就是……去珍惜当下。
It's just like, just I appreciate the moment.

1265
01:08:52,750 --> 01:08:55,839
我最近读到一篇博客，大概说的是，
There was a blog post recently I read that was something like,

1266
01:08:55,839 --> 01:08:59,230
比如“享受这个三明治”，我记得大概就是这个意思。
like enjoy the sandwich, I think is literally the sense.

1267
01:08:59,310 --> 01:09:01,759
不知道你有没有看过，大概是有个人说，
I don't know if you saw this or it was like somebody was like, yeah,

1268
01:09:01,759 --> 01:09:03,120
就像你正在吃一个三明治。
like just you're eating a sandwich.

1269
01:09:03,200 --> 01:09:06,360
你懂的，你已经吃过很多三明治了。享受你当下这个三明治。
You know, you've eaten many sandwiches. Like enjoy the sandwich you're in.

1270
01:09:06,440 --> 01:09:09,000
你正在开一个团队会议，你懂的。对。
You're in like a, a team meeting, you know. Yeah.

1271
01:09:09,040 --> 01:09:12,446
你已经经历过很多次了。就是去享受、沉浸其中，不要总看向——
You've been in them, like, like enjoy, like be, be in it and, and sort of not looking,

1272
01:09:12,446 --> 01:09:13,840
总看向下一件事。
looking towards the next thing.

1273
01:09:14,200 --> 01:09:15,880
我参加过一次冥想静修。
I did a meditation retreat once.

1274
01:09:16,000 --> 01:09:20,080
那是一次十天的止语静修，吃饭时也保持安静，没人说话。
It was a 10 day silent retreat where you eat silently, too, and no one's talking.

1275
01:09:20,160 --> 01:09:21,280
你就坐在那里吃自己的食物。
You just sit there and eat your food.

1276
01:09:21,610 --> 01:09:26,122
我只记得剥一个鸡蛋剥了五分钟，只是去注意每一片——
And I just remember peeling an egg for like five minutes and just noticing every,

1277
01:09:26,122 --> 01:09:30,230
每一片蛋壳，还有那股气味，而且你几乎……
every shell piece and just the smell of it all and, and it like, you almost,

1278
01:09:30,230 --> 01:09:32,250
那种状态其实挺难进入的。
it's like hard to get into that mode.

1279
01:09:32,610 --> 01:09:35,530
但那个状态特别有意思，一切都变得很有趣。
But it's such an interesting place to be where everything is just interesting.

1280
01:09:35,730 --> 01:09:40,370
就像是“哇，这个鸡蛋”，而不是随便往嘴里塞东西。对吧。
Like, wow, this egg versus just like stuff through my mouth. Yeah, right.

1281
01:09:40,410 --> 01:09:42,345
