01:10:16,315 --> 01:10:18,310
应该尽量保持一点轻松感。
you should aim to kind of have some levity.

1294
01:10:18,710 --> 01:10:23,270
所以我觉得，如果你看我大脑内部，肯定会惊讶，
And so I think if, if you looked inside my brain, you'd definitely be surprised, uh,

1295
01:10:23,270 --> 01:10:26,310
基本上在任何时刻，我都在……
that like basically at any given moment, I'm just like.

1296
